  "title": "Broccoli Quiche with Mashed Potato Crust",
  "description": "A broccoli and cheese quiche in a light, crispy potato crust. A new twist on a familiar favorite. And a great way to use left over potatoes!",
  "authors": [
    "Stackhawkley"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-08-19T20:28:28-04:00",
